WEBVTT

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.270
You can be so rude! This is a puzzle.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.370
I am the Giver.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.900
You are the Solver.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.900
And the prize is...

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.780
Jin Makata.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.130
I dare you to solve this puzzle!

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.340
Try to find the two of us!

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.790
Why the hell are you doing this?!

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.470
You were gonna leave Jin with us!
I thought we had your word!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.540
That line? Humph!

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.800
Kaito, you’re so trusting
you’d fall for absolutely anything!

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:38.690
It’s hard to believe you’re one of
the genius Phi-Brain children!

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.810
I’m so sick and tired of acting
like I’m one of your friends!

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.910
I am going to take a walk
down memory lane with Jin.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.750
As far as I’m concerned,
Jin is all that matters.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:56.540
I will get Jin’s memories
back along with my old Jin!

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.380
I’ll make Jin mine once more!

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.820
Kaito?

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.720
Raetsel took off with Jin!

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:09.350
And to make matters worse,
she made a puzzle with Jin as the prize.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.640
Damn that unlucky black cat!

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:14.270
What are you going to do, Kaito?

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:19.280
Isn’t it obvious? I’ll solve
the puzzle and get Jin back!

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:25.070
This indicates the locations Jin
visited during his blank year.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.070
With the world as the game field,

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:33.160
an incredible puzzle
time is about to begin!

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:09.000
What is Your Real Dream?

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:21.310
Wow! Texas is too huge, isn’t it?

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:26.260
You said it! It’s
friggin’ humungous!

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.280
And since we’re searchin’
for a party of two,

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:30.200
I’m not even sure how to
go about looking for them!

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.330
We’re definitely in the right spot.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.830
Isn’t the picture Raetsel
sent us our only hint?

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:43.410
But for there to be a picture,
doesn’t it prove that Jin really was here?

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:48.170
There is no way in the world Raetsel is
going to make the puzzle that easy.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:52.470
I’m sure we’ll find another hint here
somewhere around here.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.260
He’ll be fine, Kaito.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:01.060
After all, Raetsel loves
Jin! She’d never hurt him.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:04.730
Yeah. I feel the same way.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.570
Then there’s no need to
get your panties in a bunch!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.950
Let’s start focusin’
on solvin’ this puzzle!

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.060
Gammon...

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:15.080
Don’t get the wrong idea!
I’m not here for you.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.020
This is a puzzle that spans
across the whole world!

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.820
Gammon the Great here will
be the one to solve it!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.000
I’m not gonna let a
punk like you help me!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.340
Who ever said I was here to help?!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.540
What was that, jerk?!

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.090
Gotta problem?! Well?!

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.210
I’m gonna solve it!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:29.590
Don’t be stupid, Nimrod!

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.380
Now, now! That’s enough of that.

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.340
Ah, thief!

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:34.430
Nonoha!

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:35.220
Lemme go!

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:36.350
Back at ya!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.900
Think again!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.360
Try a taste of this!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.820
Where did Nonoha run off to?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.100
You had no right to do that!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.610
Let go of me!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.040
What’re you doin’ to Nonoha?!

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.330
Gammon, wait!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.570
Damn thief!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:06.740
Brother!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.490
You ain’t Nonoha!

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.510
What do you think you were
doing to my big brother?!

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.970
Crap!

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:14.830
Gammon!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.330
My name is Nono!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.780
But dang! You two really
resemble each other.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.060
Standing side by side,
we could pass as sisters.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:38.410
I’m glad to hear it! I’ve
always wanted a big sister.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.500
I know! It feels like I’ve got a new
little sister--I’m tickled pink!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.620
Really?

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:47.450
Supposedly we’ve all got three people
identical to us somewhere out there,

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.090
but this is overkill.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:53.200
Since our names are “Nonoha” and “Nono,”
they’re only two letters off.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:57.460
And her fighting prowess is
even on par with Nonoha’s...

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.060
That uppercut really packed a wallop!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:03.730
Guys shouldn’t go around whining!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.020
Youch!

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.610
Brat! Don’t randomly
flick my forehead!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:10.820
Sheesh! Not only does she have Nonoha’s
brute strength, but she’s also a tease!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.320
Who has brute strength?

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.070
Oh, well, I meant...

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.280
Gammon, you’re such a wuss!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.230
Buzz off!

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.330
Kaito, is something the matter?

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.690
Don’t you think “Nono” and “Nonoha”
sound a bit too similar?

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.790
Are we falling for one
of Raetsel’s traps...?

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:29.340
No, this could be a hint for her puzzle.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.610
You’re reading too much into things!

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.170
This is a puzzle!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.500
It’s just a map!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:43.720
Jeez, Kaito! You think everything’s
a puzzle. Try to relax.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.310
Right, Nono?

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:51.260
Hey, Nonoha? Could you become
my big sister for real?

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.260
I mean it! Why not?

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.350
You could become my sister and then you,

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.530
me and my big brother could live together!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.270
What?! Don’t ask for the imposs--

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.410
Aw, crud...

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.540
Really, Gammon!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.780
Are you okay?

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.630
Is this picture a hint?

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.660
How could it possibly be a hint?

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.880
Is this your big brother, Nono?

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:21.220
Yep! My big brother
was the captain of the

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:23.670
basketball team when he was in high school!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:27.420
Sheeit! I don’t care if he played
basketball or dunceball!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:32.110
For all of his photos to be stashed away,
he musta sucked pretty bad.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.190
Sheesh! Some guys can
be pains in the ass!

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.540
I could say the exact same about you.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:37.680
Brother?

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:42.440
Crying wolf wasn’t enough,
so now you’ve come to mock me as well?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.150
I give you an inch and you take a mile!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.370
Keep your hands off of me!

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.660
What was that?! You
lookin’ for a fight?!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.940
Gammon, knock it off!
Sure! You’re pissin’ me off!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.210
Brother! Don’t fight with him!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:54.570
I’ve never been here before
so I don’t know your ways!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.130
It looks like we’ve found
two more peas in a pod.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.760
Let’s settle this through basketball!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:04.210
I’ll smash the living daylights
outta you with your own forte!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.210
What’s wrong? Tremblin’
in your boots?

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.970
You’re just a big chicken-wuss!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:15.840
What?!

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:18.850
Don’t expect to get past me
when you’ve got the ball.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.170
S-say, could you tell me
about your brother...?

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:44.760
In high school, he was a star player,
attracting recruiters from across America!

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:46.630
I figured...

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:49.790
What?!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.640
Up for some more?

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:05.910
Damn it! Fine, I get it! I lost.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.770
You’re pretty stinkin’ good!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:14.150
And to be fair, well, you
didn’t suck too bad out there.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.250
You are such a punk!

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:23.220
Brother, you’re the best!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:27.010
C’mon! You really oughta attend that
pro basketball team’s tryout!

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:27.640
What?

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.520
It’s not too late if you went now!

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.890
Nono, I’ve already quit basketball...

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:34.650
But--

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:38.930
How many times must I tell you?!
Don’t bring this up again!

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.600
Brother...

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.740
Brother, you’re such a jerk!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:59.130
It had always been my big brother’s dream
to become a pro basketball player.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.830
Didn’t recruiters
even come to see him?

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.170
Uh-huh...

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.180
Then why...?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.930
Last year, our mom and
dad died in an accident.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:16.460
Joe said that he would
carry on our dad’s work

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:20.840
until I graduated and gave up basketball...

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:24.650
In that case, are you two
livin’ here on your own?

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.350
So your family circumstances are just
like Gammon’s and Miharu’s.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:33.330
My brother... He loves
basketball so much, but...

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:39.430
Enigma...!

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:43.490
Hello.

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:56.280
That’s why I signed him up for
the tryouts without telling him.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.510
But then he got angry at me.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.820
Is that why you two were
arguing at the airport?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:09.110
Joe, your brother, is grateful for what
you did for him. I’m sure of it.

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:09.950
Huh?

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:13.400
But he can’t fess up to how he feels,
so he’s hidin’ it with anger.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:19.390
Otherwise he couldn’t pose
as a “cool big brother.”

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.910
Were you that way, Gammon?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:26.170
Beats me! I can’t really
say since I don’t remember.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:30.680
So what exactly does Joe
do for a living now?

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.920
Puzzles. He said that he’s
a puzzle administrator.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.180
What?!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:35.920
Say what?!

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:39.530
He said he gets paid
to overlook a puzzle.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.980
This is the puzzle.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:47.680
He looks at this maze
everyday like a madman.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.650
Is this for real?

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:53.190
The way my brother has been
acting lately is kinda scary...

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.620
I want him to go back to
the way he used to be!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.250
Nono, have you ever seen these two?

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.900
Nuh-uh. I don’t recognize them.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.250
Too bad...

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.920
It sounds like my brother’s back.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.410
Brother!

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:13.750
Joe!

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.880
To think that you’re
Phi-Brain children...

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:20.010
Dude, are you one of the--?!

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:23.510
Yeah. I’m a Master Brain.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:29.140
In accordance to my pledge with Jin Makata,
I will annihilate all puzzlers.

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.450
That is my dream now.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:48.510
This maze is Raetsel’s puzzle...

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.910
Raetsel’s puzzle? What
are you talking about?

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.370
Don’t play dumb!

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:59.020
I’m being dead serious.
I inherited this puzzle from my dad.

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:03.670
Although this is my first
time coming here in person...

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:05.090
What?

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.480
In the olden times, the two competitors

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.300
would race through the
maze on horseback.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.180
But now we’ll use these puppies!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:16.560
Brother, stop it! These
are your new friends!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.190
This is none of your business.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.690
Brother!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.320
So, who will it be?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.140
You’re gonna have to face me!

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.920
Don’t butt in when you
can’t even ride a bike.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:30.580
When it comes to bikes,
it’s me or no one!

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:37.790
The maze’s course should match the
projection on your helmet visor.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:43.310
Whoever reaches the goal first wins.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:54.450
I take it you’re ready. Not that it matters
since I’m obviously going to win.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:55.060
What?

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:58.620
I know this maze better than anyone.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.280
Better than anyone beside
my belated dad, that is.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.250
What’ll you do? If you wanna quit,
this is your last chance.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.040
There’s no way in
hell I’m gonna quit!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:10.170
You’re dreamin’ if you think Galileo,
the Great Gammon,

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:13.080
is gonna lose to a newb who has
never raced through a maze before!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:15.330
I hope you don’t regret those words.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:17.960
What?!

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.590
The loser gets a negro muerte!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.130
It means “black death!”

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.640
Bring it on!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:42.160
Puzzle time... Let’s begin!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:51.960
So you gave up basketball to raise Nono
and use this puzzle to pay the bills?

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.090
Nice going!

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:53.910
Shut up!

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.160
Damn it!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:01.290
I’ll do whatever it takes to win!

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:11.050
Joe! I’ve got a little
sister back home.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.050
I’ve raised my sister off of puzzles.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:21.020
You seriously think I’m gonna let a
puzzle bumpkin like you beat me?

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.080
Don’t make me laugh!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.150
Be quiet!

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.610
Brother!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.710
Bastard!

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.800
The wall has crumbled!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.120
The brakes are out!

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:44.390
Even if you hit the brakes,
these bikes aren’t about to stop!

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.640
They’ll keep going
until one of us wins!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.060
Jerk!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:52.630
He’s gonna crash!

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.150
Punk, get over yourself!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.080
Thank goodness...

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.500
If he uses this maze’s walls to his advantage,
he could take the lead!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:19.340
You’re makin’ excuses for yourself,
claimin’ you gave up on your dream

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.840
for your sister and for your livelihood!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:24.330
A loser like you could
never ride in front of me!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:36.180
I’ll prove that I am fully
capable of solving this maze!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.810
Geh! Not again!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.530
It doesn’t matter how hard you try!

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:57.040
The only thing you’re proving is the
extent of your own stupidity!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:00.940
Can you say with pride that
you wanna do this badly

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.580
enough to make Nono, your own sister, cry?!

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:04.950
Shut up!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.210
Now victory is as good as mine!

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.720
Brother! That’s enough!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:18.850
Nono...

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:24.260
That... That isn’t the Joe I know...!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:26.730
Nono...

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.740
This is part of a Master Brain’s job?

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:39.490
Damn it!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:51.310
That idiot! What’s he thinking?!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.100
That’s a dead end!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:58.690
Now that it’s come to this...

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:03.070
If I wanna win, I don’t
have much choice!

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:06.890
Give up! You’ll die if you try!

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.230
I get it!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.150
Push the button by your hand!

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:16.400
That will stop the bike.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.750
I ain’t givin’ up!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.250
Damn it!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.940
Boo-yah!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.580
Sweet!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.070
Joe!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:03.330
Brother!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.070
Laugh if you want.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:29.780
Not only did I give up my
dream, but now look at me!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.600
You never gave up on your dream.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.470
Isn’t that why you think you look lame?

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.380
I was just like you, so I
know exactly how you feel.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.420
What is your real dream?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:45.970
Nono won’t be happy if
you give that dream up.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:49.870
I’m pretty sure Nono’s tears
aren’t what you’re looking for.

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.630
You’re a lucky bastard if you’ve got someone
there rootin’ for you and your dream.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.850
So don’t give up!

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.190
Bet everything you’ve got
on that dream and shine!

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:05.070
Brother!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:10.620
Nono...

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.410
Brother!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.500
Brother, you’re so
stupid! You stupid moron!

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:19.900
Moron!

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.920
I’m sorry, Nono...

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.500
Huh?

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:35.480
What’s that?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.550
Numbers?

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.050
Are you leaving?

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:44.310
Yeah.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:48.320
Those numbers represented
latitude and longitude.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:52.360
We might be able to find the people
we’re searching for if we go there.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:55.950
I see. Please feel free to
come back whenever you like.

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.190
You’re always welcome here.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.080
Thank you.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:00.190
Nono, take care!

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:06.420
Uh-huh! And if you ever feel like moving
in with us, just give us a call!

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:09.960
Hey! Can that talk and move
on to basketball! Basketball!

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:13.210
This is all you’ve got now.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.150
Yeah!

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:27.150
Cool!

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.780
H-hey!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:32.490
I’ll let you know when I debut in
my first pro basketball game!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.980
You’d better come watch!

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:38.450
Yeah! I’ll be sure to watch
you get your ass kicked.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.200
What?! Don’t underestimate me!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.980
Hah! Back at you!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:42.960
What?!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:43.710
Wanna fight?!

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:44.170
They never learn...

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:44.830
You need to get off your high horse!
They never learn...

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:46.420
You need to get off your high horse!
Seriously!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:50.490
Hey, let’s go! We’ve gotta find Jin!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:53.680
Let’s solve Raetsel’s puzzle!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:02.640
Well, that’s all right.

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:07.470
That pushover was nothing more
than a disposable pawn.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:13.280
Raetsel’s puzzle has just begun...

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:04.850
Let’s hurry! We’re going
to personally get Jin back.

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:05.640
Yeah!

00:24:05.640 --> 00:24:07.690
Welcome to POG Air.

00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:10.170
I am Bishop and I shall
be your pilot today.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:11.860
Mr. Bishop, did you change jobs?

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:14.110
The POG must be understaffed...

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:16.650
Before takeoff, please
listen to this song.

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:19.820
I composed this song, entitled,
“Master Rook, I Praise Thee from My Heart.”

00:24:20.030 --> 00:24:23.700
“I’m being told
to adlib the song.”

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:25.080
Next time, “Just Now, I
was Thinking of Someone.”

00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:27.980
"I am being tested!
Tested by this show!”

00:24:25.080 --> 00:24:27.450
Ana, let’s take another plane...

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:29.080
Master Rook!

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.990
GRUMBLE...! Kya! I’m so hungry!
Oh, dear! I’m sorry! Art: Akeru Otsuki
